    "sections": {
        "description": "The Electrical Services theme is tailored for websites focusing on electric work, engineering assistance, and repair solutions. It features organized layouts for service details, team sections, contact information, testimonials, and project showcases, all designed to ensure easy navigation and responsive functionality on various devices. With built-in customization options, users can effortlessly modify colors, typography, banners, and page layouts without compromising usability. The theme also accommodates image galleries, call-to-action sections, and service listings, making it ideal for electrical repair professionals and other house services providers. Its clean code structure and optimized layouts ensure consistent performance and accessibility, while also being suitable for businesses involved in installation, inspection, wiring, and equipment servicing."
    },
